<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Interneuron downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Interneuron downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Securities International Inc downgraded to neutral from buy its rating of Interneuron Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
<p>The rating is based on its belief that sales of Interneuron's Redux diet drug will come under significant pressure due to a study released by the Mayo Clinic which suggests a link between a diet drug therapy, phen/fen, and heart valve disease.</p>
<p>Vector said negative publicity about diet drugs could be carried over to Interneuron's drug by consumers.</p>
<p>Shares of Interneuron were trading off 5/8 to 16-1/2.</p>
<p>		    ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
